#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "How to list programs available in Serverless, pass inputs into these programs, run them remotely, check status, and retrieve results and logs."
msgstr "Cara melihat daftar program yang tersedia di Serverless, meneruskan input ke program-program tersebut, menjalankannya dari jarak jauh, memeriksa status, dan mengambil hasil serta log."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run your first Qiskit Serverless workload remotely"
msgstr "Jalankan workload Qiskit Serverless pertamamu dari jarak jauh"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<OpenInLabBanner notebookPath=\"guides/serverless-run-first-workload.ipynb\" />\n"
msgstr "<OpenInLabBanner notebookPath=\"guides/serverless-run-first-workload.ipynb\" />\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Package versions\">\n"
msgstr ""
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Versi paket\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The code on this page was developed using the following requirements.\n"
"We recommend using these versions or newer.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kode di halaman ini dikembangkan menggunakan persyaratan berikut.\n"
"Kami menyarankan menggunakan versi ini atau yang lebih baru.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
"<Admonition type=\"tip\">\n"
"**Qiskit Serverless is getting an upgrade, and its features are changing fast.** During this development phase, find release notes and the most recent documentation at the [Qiskit Serverless GitHub](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-serverless/index.html) page.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
"<Admonition type=\"tip\">\n"
"**Qiskit Serverless sedang mendapatkan pembaruan, dan fitur-fiturnya berubah dengan cepat.** Selama fase pengembangan ini, temukan catatan rilis dan dokumentasi terbaru di halaman [Qiskit Serverless GitHub](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-serverless/index.html).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This section explores how to use `qiskit-ibm-catalog` to list programs available in Qiskit Serverless, pass inputs into these programs, run them remotely, check their status, and retrieve results and logs.\n"
msgstr "Bagian ini membahas cara menggunakan `qiskit-ibm-catalog` untuk melihat daftar program yang tersedia di Qiskit Serverless, meneruskan input ke program-program tersebut, menjalankannya dari jarak jauh, memeriksa statusnya, dan mengambil hasil serta log.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Be sure you have followed the workflow in [Write your first Qiskit Serverless program](/guides/serverless-first-program) before you begin.\n"
msgstr "Pastikan kamu sudah mengikuti alur kerja di [Tulis program Qiskit Serverless pertamamu](/guides/serverless-first-program) sebelum kamu mulai.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "List programs available {#list-programs-available}"
msgstr "Daftar program yang tersedia {#list-programs-available}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can use `QiskitServerless.list()` to fetch a list of the available programs to run with Qiskit Serverless. This includes the previously uploaded [`transpile_remote_serverless`](/guides/serverless-first-program).\n"
msgstr "Kamu bisa menggunakan `QiskitServerless.list()` untuk mengambil daftar program yang tersedia untuk dijalankan dengan Qiskit Serverless. Ini termasuk [`transpile_remote_serverless`](/guides/serverless-first-program) yang sebelumnya sudah diunggah.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run an uploaded program and pass inputs {#run-an-uploaded-program-and-pass-inputs}"
msgstr "Jalankan program yang sudah diunggah dan teruskan input {#run-an-uploaded-program-and-pass-inputs}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "First, set up your inputs. Your program has three inputs: `circuits`, `backend`, and `optimization_level`. You can use `random_circuit` to create 30 random circuits:\n"
msgstr "Pertama, siapkan inputmu. Programmu memiliki tiga input: `circuits`, `backend`, dan `optimization_level`. Kamu bisa menggunakan `random_circuit` untuk membuat 30 Circuit acak:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/guides/serverless-run-first-workload/extracted-outputs/46108a95-11f8-4ecf-83bb-131c3e7ea4c2-0.svg)\n"
msgstr "![Output dari sel kode sebelumnya](/docs/images/guides/serverless-run-first-workload/extracted-outputs/46108a95-11f8-4ecf-83bb-131c3e7ea4c2-0.svg)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next, use `QiskitRuntimeService` and `least_busy` to select a `backend`:\n"
msgstr "Selanjutnya, gunakan `QiskitRuntimeService` dan `least_busy` untuk memilih `backend`:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Set your optimization level:\n"
msgstr "Atur level optimisasimu:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Select your program with `serverless.load('PROGRAM_NAME')`:\n"
msgstr "Pilih programmu dengan `serverless.load('PROGRAM_NAME')`:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next, pass your inputs and run it in a pythonic fashion as follows:\n"
msgstr "Selanjutnya, teruskan inputmu dan jalankan secara pythonic seperti berikut:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"serverless-job-status\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"serverless-job-status\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Check job status {#check-job-status}"
msgstr "Periksa status job {#check-job-status}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "With your Qiskit Serverless `job_id`, you can check the status of running jobs. This includes the following statuses:\n"
msgstr "Dengan `job_id` Qiskit Serverless milikmu, kamu bisa memeriksa status job yang sedang berjalan. Ini mencakup status-status berikut:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**`QUEUED`**: The remote program is in the Qiskit Serverless queue. The queue priority is currently based on how much you've used Qiskit Serverless\n"
msgstr "**`QUEUED`**: Program jarak jauh sedang berada dalam antrean Qiskit Serverless. Prioritas antrean saat ini didasarkan pada seberapa banyak kamu telah menggunakan Qiskit Serverless\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**`INITIALIZING`**: The remote program is starting; this includes setting up the remote environment and installing dependencies\n"
msgstr "**`INITIALIZING`**: Program jarak jauh sedang dimulai; ini termasuk menyiapkan lingkungan jarak jauh dan menginstal dependensi\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**`RUNNING`**: The program is running. At this stage, if you have `print()` outputs in your program, you can retrieve logs using `job.logs()`\n"
msgstr "**`RUNNING`**: Program sedang berjalan. Pada tahap ini, jika kamu memiliki output `print()` dalam programmu, kamu bisa mengambil log menggunakan `job.logs()`\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**`DONE`**: The program is complete, and you can retrieve data stored in `save_result()` with `job.results()`\n"
msgstr "**`DONE`**: Program sudah selesai, dan kamu bisa mengambil data yang tersimpan di `save_result()` dengan `job.results()`\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can also set more detailed job statuses in [Manage Qiskit Serverless compute and data resources](/guides/serverless-manage-resources).\n"
msgstr "Kamu juga bisa mengatur status job yang lebih detail di [Kelola sumber daya komputasi dan data Qiskit Serverless](/guides/serverless-manage-resources).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "<Admonition type=\"tip\">\n"
#| "Currently, the IBM Quantum workloads table only reflects Qiskit Runtime workloads. Use `job.status()` to see your Qiskit Serverless workload's current status.\n"
#| "</Admonition>\n"
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\">\n"
"Currently, the IBM Quantum workloads table only reflects IBM Quantum Compute Service workloads. Use `job.status()` to see your Qiskit Serverless workload's current status.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\">\n"
"Saat ini, tabel workload IBM Quantum hanya menampilkan workload Qiskit Runtime. Gunakan `job.status()` untuk melihat status terkini workload Qiskit Serverless-mu.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You've successfully run your first Qiskit Serverless program!\n"
msgstr "Kamu telah berhasil menjalankan program Qiskit Serverless pertamamu!\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Retrieve logs and results {#retrieve-logs-and-results}"
msgstr "Ambil log dan hasil {#retrieve-logs-and-results}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "As mentioned before, once a program is `RUNNING`, you can use `job.logs()` to fetch logs created from `print()` outputs:\n"
msgstr "Seperti yang disebutkan sebelumnya, setelah program berada dalam status `RUNNING`, kamu bisa menggunakan `job.logs()` untuk mengambil log yang dibuat dari output `print()`:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "At any time, you can also cancel a job:\n"
msgstr "Kapan saja, kamu juga bisa membatalkan job:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Once a program is `DONE`, you can use `job.results()` to fetch the result stored in `save_result()`:\n"
msgstr "Setelah program berada dalam status `DONE`, kamu bisa menggunakan `job.results()` untuk mengambil hasil yang tersimpan di `save_result()`:\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "List jobs previously run with Qiskit Serverless {#list-jobs-previously-run-with-qiskit-serverless}"
msgstr "Daftar job yang sebelumnya dijalankan dengan Qiskit Serverless {#list-jobs-previously-run-with-qiskit-serverless}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can use `jobs()` to list all jobs submitted to Qiskit Serverless:\n"
msgstr "Kamu bisa menggunakan `jobs()` untuk melihat daftar semua job yang dikirimkan ke Qiskit Serverless:\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Langkah selanjutnya {#next-steps}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<Admonition type=\"info\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
msgstr "<Admonition type=\"info\" title=\"Rekomendasi\">\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Explore [compute and data management tools](/guides/serverless-manage-resources) available to your program, including parallelization.\n"
msgstr "Jelajahi [alat manajemen komputasi dan data](/guides/serverless-manage-resources) yang tersedia untuk programmu, termasuk paralelisasi.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "</Admonition>\n"
msgstr "</Admonition>\n"
